{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Components Molecules / Rich text (built from Rich text block: Heading 1 to 4, Lead, Paragraph, Bulleted list, Numbered list, Quote, Image, Divider)
  content   the HTML (article.content, page.content, product.description)
  class     placement only; the parent sets the width (max-w-prose-width)
  24px between blocks, 16px extra above h2 and h3. Lead has no HTML equivalent; the first paragraph stays body/base.
{%- endcomment -%}
